{"id":"saludo","lemma":"saludo","pos":"noun","rank":1932,"glosses":["greeting, greetings","salutation"],"ipa":"/saˈludo/","gender":"m","forms":{"plural":"saludos"},"audio":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/1/17/LL-Q1321_%28spa%29-Marreromarco-saludo.wav","examples":[{"text":"Dale mis saludos.","en":"Give him my regards.","words":[{"g":"OK, okey dokey, right"},{"g":"my"},null]},{"text":"Si viene, denle mis saludos.","en":"If he comes, give him my regards.","words":[{"g":"if, whether"},{"g":"to come","l":"venir"},{"g":"to give, to give out","l":"dar"},{"g":"my"},null]},{"text":"Ellos intercambiaron saludos.","en":"They exchanged hellos.","audio":"https://tatoeba.org/en/audio/download/461623","words":[{"g":"they","l":"él"},{"g":"to interchange","l":"intercambiar"},null]},{"text":"Mi hermano te manda sus saludos.","en":"My brother sends you his regards.","words":[{"g":"my"},{"g":"brother"},{"g":"you"},{"g":"vow"},{"g":"his, her, its, their"},null]},{"text":"Mándale mis saludos a tu esposa.","en":"Give my regards to your wife.","words":[{"g":"to send","l":"mandar"},{"g":"my"},null,{"g":"to"},{"g":"your"},{"g":"wife"}]}]}